// Trees shedding their leaves. Crowns are ellipses and trunks are lines; every leaf has its own
// rotation and spin, and tumbles through a looping sprite sheet. Falling leaves ride gusts, pile
// up on the ground and fade. Hold the mouse to blow them around.
